<h2>The Core of the Proposal — The Development Flow Stays as It Is, AI Does the Knowledge Work</h2>
<p>The purpose of this proposal is not to build a simple company Wiki. It is to build a platform where AI continuously analyzes the development results accumulating in GitLab, extracts knowledge from them, and compares it with existing knowledge to decide whether to <strong>create, update, or retire</strong>. An employee's workflow stays exactly as it is today — writing wiki pages, editing Markdown, registering Tags, classifying documents, organizing knowledge: <strong>none of it is asked of them</strong>. Employees only search and read the knowledge that finally gets produced.</p>

